			"&e&lFlint and Steel"
			"&8&m                            "
			""
			"&7Craft flint and steel. Occultism needs an open flame to"
			"&7spark several rituals and ignite chalk circles."
			""
			"&e&lCategory:&r &fGear"
			""
			"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A humble tool, but a few rituals will not start without it."
