			"&3&lScribes Table"
			"&8&m                            "
			""
			"&7Craft the Scribes Table. Here you combine glyphs onto"
			"&7a spell parchment to script your own spells."
			""
			"&3&lCategory:&r &fApparatus"
			""
			"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7This is the heart of the mod. Build it the moment you can."
