			""
			"&7Rejects a pending teleport request. Use it when"
			"&7you would rather not be disturbed right now."
			""
			"&d&lUsage:&r  &f/tpdeny"
			""
			"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Ignoring a request also works, it expires on its own, but /tpdeny tells the player clearly."
